Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.94,0:00:03.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要永远关上地狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're about to close the gates of hell forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.48,0:00:06.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(迪恩·温彻斯特   英勇的猎人)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:08.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(走过的路)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:20.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一直在炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in Purgatory?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.37,0:00:21.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我觉得纯粹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It felt pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.42,0:00:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不做猎人了  我找到了一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't hunt anymore. I found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.70,0:00:25.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你找我了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you look for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.65,0:00:26.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文·谭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin Tran.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.74,0:00:28.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以为你能躲我一辈子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you could elude me forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.16,0:00:29.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝建立了一系列测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}God built a series of tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.61,0:00:31.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你都完成了  就可以去关地狱之门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you've done all three, you can slam the gates of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.56,0:00:33.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-第一项是什么  -杀一只地狱之犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where do we start? - Kill a hound of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.31,0:00:35.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从地狱拯救一个无辜的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}An innocent soul has to be rescued from hell 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.67,0:00:36.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并将它送入天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}and delivered unto heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.85,0:00:37.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后的测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the final test?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.91,0:00:38.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,治愈一个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}To cure a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:42.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿比顿  她是一个地狱骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abbadon, a knight of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.90,0:00:43.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.60,0:00:44.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫娜奥米\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Naomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.65,0:00:46.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We rescued you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.52,0:00:50.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angel tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.67,0:00:52.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会伤害迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't hurt Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.12,0:00:53.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.43,0:00:55.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.65,0:00:58.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要保护这块石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to protect this tablet now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.57,0:00:59.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}These trials --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.74,0:01:01.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们在净化我\N{\fnArial\fs30}...they're purifying me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.83,0:01:06.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-梅塔特隆  -我是神的书记员\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Metatron? - I'm the scribe of god.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.97,0:01:08.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天堂需要你的帮助  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven needs your help, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.76,0:01:15.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在杀你们救过的每一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm killing everyone you've ever saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.97,0:01:17.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们就该接受条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should just take the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.26,0:01:19.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,测试  全部都放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trials -- you'll give them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.33,0:01:21.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会像以往一样打个漂亮仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kick it in the ass like we always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.06,0:01:22.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要和我一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.27,0:01:26.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.48,0:01:32.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,免费的  警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the house, sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.79,0:01:34.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  南茜  但我没点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thanks, Nance, but I didn't order --
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.75,0:01:37.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那么...  -祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So... - Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.75,0:01:39.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要喝什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}...what are we drinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.04,0:01:41.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗德里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roderick?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.91,0:01:43.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔迪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, Jody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:46.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我简直无法形容\N{\fnArial\fs30}Words cannot begin to describe
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.04,0:01:48.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那张照片是多么有辱你的美貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}the injustice that that picture does to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.73,0:01:53.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.74,0:01:57.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么  -瞧瞧你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.95,0:02:00.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好工作  好西服\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fancy career, the suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.23,0:02:05.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我不过就是个小镇女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty much what I am -- small-town girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.85,0:02:09.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们是有共同点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do share something, you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.23,0:02:11.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.83,0:02:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失去亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.33,0:02:26.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的儿子和丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son and my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.09,0:02:29.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.08,0:02:35.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也失去过亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lost someone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.94,0:02:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非要流眼泪才叫约会呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a date till I've cried.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.19,0:02:50.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你流过泪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now you've cried.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.17,0:03:00.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这真是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.06,0:03:03.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.26,0:03:06.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.10,0:03:13.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过他是挺有魅力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's attractive, though, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.15,0:03:17.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺性感的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.10,0:03:23.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.36,0:03:27.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.01,0:03:47.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你们一分钟  然后你们一位亲切可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have less than one minute before a very dear, attractive,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.49,0:03:50.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,略有醉意的朋友就会断气\N{\fnArial\fs30}and slightly tipsy friend of yours snuffs it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.11,0:03:52.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停手吧  克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call it off, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.36,0:03:53.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.75,0:03:56.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为都结束了  你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's over, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.50,0:03:57.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们愿意交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.89,0:03:59.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三十秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.90,0:04:02.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们停止测试  你停止杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stop the trials, and you stop the killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:07.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要恶魔石碑  整块石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want the demon tablet -- the whole demon tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:09.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  但天使石碑得给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, but then the angel tablet comes to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.18,0:04:10.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凭什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}On what grounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.36,0:04:11.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the grounds that you're a douche bag
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.87,0:04:14.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋不能掌握那么大的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no douche bag should have that much power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.58,0:04:15.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交不交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.52,0:04:21.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先  对我说一句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, I need to hear two little words --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.66,0:04:26.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}I surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.83,0:04:37.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第8季第23集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.78,0:04:42.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.98,0:04:50.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.84,0:05:08.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把恶魔石碑藏在了魔鬼下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hid the demon tablet underneath the devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.29,0:05:09.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.04,0:05:10.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  我当时神志不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I was delirious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.29,0:05:22.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定这样能行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure this is gonna work?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.82,0:05:26.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还有别的办法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What choice do we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.45,0:05:29.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  听着  这是一个秘密藏身处\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen, this is a secret lair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.92,0:05:31.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.43,0:05:33.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别带酒友去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No keggers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.21,0:05:35.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have any friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.35,0:05:38.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,低调点就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, just lay low.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.87,0:05:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.00,0:05:42.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定你马上就能回去参加奥数了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be a mathlete again before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.60,0:05:45.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.58,0:05:48.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这么做是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.53,0:05:56.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.67,0:05:56.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(德克萨斯州  休斯顿)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.29,0:05:59.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was he like?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.52,0:06:02.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.61,0:06:06.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. God?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.37,0:06:11.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就跟你想的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, pretty much like you'd expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.14,0:06:15.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神圣伟岸  暴脾气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larger-than-life, gruff, 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.17,0:06:17.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点性别歧视\N{\fnArial\fs30}bit of a sexist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.04,0:06:22.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但十分公正\N{\fnArial\fs30}But fair -- eminently fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.35,0:06:28.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个拿非利人不是好东西  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nephilim was a monster, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.47,0:06:29.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一项测试呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the next trial?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.25,0:06:32.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在街对面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Across the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.09,0:06:35.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他叫德怀特·查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Dwight Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.82,0:06:37.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在天使无线电上听\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been listening in on the angel radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.62,0:06:40.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准确说是丘比特频道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cupid frequency, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.99,0:06:44.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就是他们下一个目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he is the next on their list.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.59,0:06:45.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their list?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.87,0:06:49.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跳水平曼波舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}To do the horizontal mambo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.90,0:06:52.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碰碰肚皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slap bellies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.44,0:06:56.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到爱情\N{\fnArial\fs30}To find love.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.52,0:06:58.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.25,0:06:59.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.36,0:07:03.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在24小时之内就要被丘比特之箭射中\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's slotted to be dinged by cupid's arrow within 24 hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.97,0:07:06.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这对我们正好  因为第二项测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is good for us, because the second trial
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.55,0:07:09.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是拿到一把丘比特的弓\N{\fnArial\fs30}is retrieving cupid's bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.06,0:07:11.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用杀人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No killing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.80,0:07:16.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}No killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.23,0:07:20.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(南达柯达州  苏福尔斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.09,0:07:48.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.93,0:07:52.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么说的来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that old expression?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.29,0:07:55.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.29,0:07:55.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功有很多父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Success has many fathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.67,0:07:57.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失败姓温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Failure is a Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.66,0:07:59.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,石头在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.27,0:08:01.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把你的拿出来  我们才会拿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You show us yours, and we'll show you ours. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.30,0:08:03.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.02,0:08:05.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在尽力进行专业的谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to conduct a professional negotiation here,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.52,0:08:07.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你却说起老二来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you want to talk dangly bits?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.99,0:08:09.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.38,0:08:13.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.34,0:08:17.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.89,0:08:23.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,合同呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the contract?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.15,0:08:31.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里面肯定没有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm sure there's no hidden agendas in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.30,0:08:33.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关键部分  我们交换石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The highlights -- we swap tablets,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.96,0:08:36.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们永远放弃测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}you stand down from the trials forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.34,0:08:39.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你停止杀害我们救过的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stop killing everyone we've ever saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.34,0:08:40.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.98,0:08:51.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想得美  小松鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice try, squirrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.21,0:08:53.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鹿在做测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moose is doing these trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.65,0:08:54.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鹿来签字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moose signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.97,0:08:55.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.67,0:08:58.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没把合同一字不落地看完  他不能签\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not signing anything until I read the fine print.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.70,0:09:00.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己会看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.68,0:09:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要我来  所以我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you wanted me here. I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.70,0:09:05.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我绝不会允许他进一步坑我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll be damned if I'm gonna let him screw us even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.26,0:09:06.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.99,0:09:09.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天堂也有烦恼了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trouble in paradise, boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.75,0:09:17.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  纳撒尼尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it, Nathaniel?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.47,0:09:20.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一个自由外派员来找我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of our freelancers has reached out to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.98,0:09:23.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他找到了卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's found Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.33,0:09:26.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.43,0:09:30.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,德克萨斯休斯顿一家酒吧里\N{\fnArial\fs30}A drinking establishment in Houston, Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.82,0:09:31.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.85,0:09:34.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.92,0:09:38.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说卡西迪奥不是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says Castiel was not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.72,0:09:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他跟谁在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was he with?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.00,0:09:43.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从描述来看  我觉得是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the description, I-I think it was him --
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.39,0:09:45.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,书记员\N{\fnArial\fs30}The scribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.73,0:09:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要一直这么默念  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna move your lips the whole way up here, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.05,0:09:57.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我为什么总赢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why I always defeat you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.54,0:09:58.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为你们的人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.71,0:10:00.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是内置的缺陷\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a built-in handicap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.89,0:10:06.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们总把情感放在常识之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always put emotion ahead of good, old-fashioned common sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.70,0:10:11.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们让那个大傻瓜签了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's have the big galoot sign it now, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.67,0:10:29.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.81,0:10:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我只要\N{\fnArial\fs30}You realize all I have to do is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.31,0:10:40.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔手铐  混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demonic handcuffs, jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.43,0:10:43.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弹指响  瞬间传送  黑烟出窍都不好使\N{\fnArial\fs30}No flicking, no teleporting, no smoking out --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.16,0:10:45.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有  交易也没门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and... no deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.55,0:10:48.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你得听我们的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which pretty much means that you're our bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.13,0:10:49.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.99,0:10:53.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想跟我玩手铐  好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to play chain gang? Let's.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.26,0:10:56.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不是好惹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saddled yourself to the wrong bull, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.03,0:11:03.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以这么玩一整天  你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do this all day, 'cause you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.62,0:11:05.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这感觉棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, it feels good!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.58,0:11:06.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但不管如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}But sooner or later,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.14,0:11:10.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你早晚得承认  你归我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna have to face it -- you're ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.96,0:11:13.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你这个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means that your demon ass
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.51,0:11:16.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很快就要变成一个常人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is going to be a mortal ass pretty damn quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.69,0:11:19.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he mouthing on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.46,0:11:21.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是第三道测试  克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the third trial, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.65,0:11:30.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在看什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you reading?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.90,0:11:32.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,择偶启示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Personal advertisements.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.06,0:11:40.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那男人尽早找到爱情  丘比特也能尽早来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The faster that man finds love, the faster the cupid will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.02,0:11:42.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.31,0:11:44.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我朋友的朋友就是干这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm friends with friends who do this for a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.66,0:11:49.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-来点什么吗  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help you gents? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.77,0:11:52.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是想找一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you say that you're looking for, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.38,0:11:53.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犯罪伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}a partner in crime...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.98,0:11:56.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}...or, uh, 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.51,0:12:02.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,略有支配欲  喜欢扮演护士的女人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone who's into nurse role-play and light domination?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.96,0:12:07.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  现在是周二早上十点啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother, it's 10:00 a.m. on a Tuesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.69,0:12:09.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要两杯啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we'll have two drafts, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.20,0:12:13.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.74,0:12:18.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还真是不知委婉是何物啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the most subtle tool in the shed, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.74,0:12:21.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.13,0:12:28.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一枪不会打偏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next one won't wing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.59,0:12:30.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚去别地方打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it someplace else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.49,0:12:34.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.77,0:12:37.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你制造的麻烦还不够多吗  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't you caused enough harm already, Castiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.46,0:12:40.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手  求你  卡西迪奥  别弄得更糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop. Please, Castiel, don't make this any worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.99,0:12:43.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.73,0:13:32.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真觉得这东西能束缚得了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think this is gonna hold me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.36,0:13:36.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们能治愈我还是什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're gonna cure me or whatever it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.43,0:13:50.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's primed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.03,0:13:52.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.84,0:13:56.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实话  很久以来  我第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, for the first time in a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.60,0:13:58.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉得我们能赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}it feels like we're gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.30,0:14:00.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.73,0:14:03.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  没完事之前先别高兴得太早\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, no dancing in the end zone until we're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.86,0:14:05.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神父的指导书里怎么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the good father's playbook say now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.88,0:14:07.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.74,0:14:10.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有圣地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that we got the consecrated ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.38,0:14:11.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just, uh
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.70,0:14:16.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每小时给克劳力注射一剂血  持续八小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I slip Crowley one dose of blood every hour for eight hours
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.83,0:14:19.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再用血手三明治完成仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}and seal the deal with a bloody-fist sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.12,0:14:20.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.22,0:14:22.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的血得净化过  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your blood's supposed to be purified, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.98,0:14:28.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以前做过忏悔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever, uh -- you ever done the "forgive me, father" before?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.29,0:14:30.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做过一次  小时候做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, once, when we were kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.53,0:14:34.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我现在完全不知道该说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why I have no clue what to say now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.32,0:14:37.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果需要的话  我可以提议一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I mean, I could give you suggestions if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.72,0:14:39.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}O-okay. Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.20,0:14:40.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.17,0:14:42.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就想到什么说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm just spit-balling here,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.04,0:14:45.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果我是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if I were you, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.36,0:14:50.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就说露比  杀莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby, killing Lilith,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:53.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把路西法放出来  失去你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}letting Lucifer out, losing your soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.67,0:14:55.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去炼狱之后没来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}not looking for me when I went to purgatory, 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:57.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-谢谢  -也就开个头\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks. - for starters. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.69,0:15:04.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有你六年级的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, hey, h-how about what you did to, uh, 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.58,0:15:07.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对佩妮·马克尔做的事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Penny Markle in the sixth grade?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.15,0:15:08.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先说那件吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you lead with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.54,0:15:11.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是你干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.30,0:15:14.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你快去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.79,0:15:42.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.85,0:15:48.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有人在听  我开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...if anybody's listening, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.06,0:15:52.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.69,0:15:56.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,略忙  小卡  排号吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little busy, Cass. Take a number.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.47,0:15:58.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕这事刻不容缓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid this can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.16,0:15:59.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,娜奥米带走了梅塔特隆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naomi has taken Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.99,0:16:04.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么认识梅塔特隆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know Metatron how?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.38,0:16:06.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在跟他一起进行天使测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been working with him on the angel trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.24,0:16:08.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  我们要关闭一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}The what? We're gonna shut it all down --
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.54,0:16:10.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天堂  地狱  都关上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven, hell, all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.01,0:16:19.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听说过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.11,0:16:21.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还没正式见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've never officially met.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.50,0:16:24.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,娜奥米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.72,0:16:31.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你名声远扬啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your reputation precedes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.81,0:16:34.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些大天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}The archangels --
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.01,0:16:36.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝走后他们让我向你打听情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanted me to debrief you after God left.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.27,0:16:39.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打听情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Debrief" me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:42.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you call it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.15,0:16:42.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你无从得知了  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how would you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.92,0:16:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还没来得及找你  你就跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ran before I had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.69,0:16:48.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但  我们还是走到了这一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.95,0:16:52.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们开始之前我还有一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just have one question before we begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.40,0:16:56.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定知道我们会竭力抓住\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had to know that we would leap at the chance
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.23,0:16:59.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从你脑子里挖取上帝的秘密的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}to extract all of God's secrets from that head of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.86,0:17:03.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我不禁自问  为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why I ask myself...why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.21,0:17:07.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么书记员突然冒了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did the scribe suddenly come in from the shadows?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.40,0:17:13.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且你跟卡西迪奥在一起干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what are you doing with Castiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.25,0:17:25.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.25,0:17:21.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当恩赐摆在面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Of the blessings set before you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:25.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做出选择  并知足常乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}make your choice and be content."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.87,0:17:31.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不怎么读书  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a big reader, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.03,0:17:39.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梅塔特隆  那个疯疯癫癫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron, the guy who was full-on crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.24,0:17:41.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,囤积狂的老天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}cat-lady-hoarder angel yesterday --
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.76,0:17:43.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在想拯救天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}now he wants to save heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.47,0:17:45.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he wants to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.21,0:17:47.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但只有我能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm the only one who can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.31,0:17:50.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能失败  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't fail, Dean, 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.54,0:17:53.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次不行  我需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}not on this one. I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.38,0:17:56.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  小卡  这很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Cass, that's all well and good, okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.59,0:17:57.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你是让我离开萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're asking me to leave Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.92,0:18:00.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且克劳力就被绑在里面呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we've got Crowley in there tied and tressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.22,0:18:01.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果说有谁完成艰巨任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if anybody needs a chaperone 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.45,0:18:03.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,需要有人陪着就是萨姆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}while doing the heavy lifting, it's Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.04,0:18:06.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.78,0:18:09.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.74,0:18:11.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后扔下你一人对付地狱之王吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what, and leave you here with the king of hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.68,0:18:12.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.94,0:18:14.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.13,0:18:17.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们还能把天使都关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you guys can lock the angels up, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.82,0:18:20.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.58,0:18:25.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.33,0:18:29.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也愿意把天使送回天堂去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm down with sending the angels back to heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.72,0:18:31.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们太混蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}just 'cause they're dicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.23,0:18:32.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.98,0:18:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.03,0:18:36.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就开始注射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start the injections now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.44,0:18:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是我八小时后还没回来  了结这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm not back in eight hours, finish it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.04,0:18:40.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别质疑  别犹豫\N{\fnArial\fs30}no questions, no hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.51,0:19:12.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真觉得给我注射人类的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think injecting me with human blood
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.51,0:19:13.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能把我转化成人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is gonna make me human?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.70,0:19:16.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是在麦片盒上看到的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you read that on the back of a cereal box?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.42,0:19:34.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你太自不量力了  小鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're miles out of your league, moose.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.57,0:19:39.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一小时后见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.23,0:19:47.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是在开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.44,0:19:50.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  是神之语\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It's the word of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.02,0:19:52.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  -这是块石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - It's a tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.80,0:19:54.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,翻译一下  你就是干这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, translate. That's what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.34,0:19:58.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是天使之碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Um, it's the angel tablet,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.57,0:20:00.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这辈子从没见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}which I've never laid eyes on in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.52,0:20:04.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我翻译半块恶魔石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a translation in like six hours
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.08,0:20:06.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花了六个月  妈妈还死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when it took me six months and a dead mom
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.87,0:20:09.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你要我六小时译出天使石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}to translate a piece of the demon tablet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.81,0:20:13.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用你早上的话来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And according to your own words this morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.54,0:20:15.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在不干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is not what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.87,0:20:17.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我过去干的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.09,0:20:19.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你说我可以抽身了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me I was out, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.55,0:20:21.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是的...  -你要是准备说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, well -- - And if this is gonna be
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.33,0:20:24.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"我们这种人永远无法抽身"  省省吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}the "guys like us are never out" speech, save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.36,0:20:26.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-迪恩说得对  -小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean's right. - Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.56,0:20:29.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法抽身  只有责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no out. Only duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.01,0:20:30.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the hell off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.12,0:20:33.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是上帝的先知  永远都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a prophet of the lord, always and forever...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.97,0:20:37.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到你死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}until the day you cease to exist,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.42,0:20:39.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另一位先知接替你的职位\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then another prophet takes your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.18,0:20:43.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你清楚自己眼前的任务了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, are you clear as to the task before you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.51,0:20:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就做吧  我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then do it, and let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.80,0:21:18.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么  克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell, Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.93,0:21:23.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咬人  不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biting?! Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.12,0:21:41.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.79,0:21:51.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看在一切的分上  要是有人听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the love of everything, whoever is hearing this --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.04,0:21:56.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管是谁  我是你的王\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anyone is hearing this -- this is your king.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.10,0:22:00.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上找人来帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send help immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.28,0:22:16.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到什么了吗  你去了很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything? You've been gone long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.16,0:22:17.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.59,0:22:20.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一个女性  但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was one female, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.94,0:22:22.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.39,0:22:24.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得"她"好像不是女性\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think she was female.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.13,0:22:27.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.85,0:22:28.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,免费酒水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.95,0:22:31.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那个兄弟觉得你救了他一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your, uh, buddy over there thinks you saved his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.32,0:22:40.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得工作时喝酒明智吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think it's wise to be drinking on the job?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.73,0:22:43.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你都白跟我混了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What show you been watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.71,0:22:45.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.98,0:22:47.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.54,0:22:52.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和萨姆关地狱之门是一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's one thing me and Sammy slamming the gates to the pit,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.02,0:22:55.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你要封掉天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you -- you're -- you're boarding up heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.88,0:22:57.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把自己也关进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're locking the door behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.06,0:23:01.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.38,0:23:06.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在那上面造成的伤害可不小  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did a lot of damage up there, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.58,0:23:09.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得他们会放过你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think they're just gonna let that slide?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.28,0:23:14.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是想问  我是否认为他们会杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mean do I think they'll kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.72,0:23:17.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they might.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.97,0:23:20.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.81,0:23:25.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,ET回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}E.T. goes home.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.76,0:23:32.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.01,0:23:34.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾德在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.26,0:23:36.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-得流感了  我叫盖尔  -好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Flu. I'm Gail. - Well, okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.73,0:23:38.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好戏上演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.41,0:23:39.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我帮你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me give you a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.23,0:23:40.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.77,0:23:43.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是个绅士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a real gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.25,0:23:46.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  这简直就是我看过的所有毛片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crud, this is like the first five minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.27,0:23:48.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前五分钟的戏码\N{\fnArial\fs30}of every porno I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.61,0:23:49.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.08,0:23:53.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位是盖尔  这位是罗德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gail, Rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.68,0:23:57.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-女士  -罗德是这儿的常客\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ma'am. - Rod rides a stool here most days.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.30,0:24:02.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二位回见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be seeing you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.81,0:24:09.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.96,0:24:11.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.79,0:24:17.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈的  太帅了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, that's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.44,0:24:27.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一杯我请吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about the next one's on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.89,0:24:37.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样了  小鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}How we doing, moose?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.27,0:24:41.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是到了爱心注射的时候了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't it about time for the next love injection?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.86,0:24:45.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,改...改...改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ch-ch-ch-ch-changes,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.40,0:24:47.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,转身面对那奇怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}turn and face the strange
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.93,0:24:50.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,改...改...改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}ch-ch-changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.14,0:24:52.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须要重新做人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just gonna have to be a different man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.59,0:24:57.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时光或许改变了我  但我无法追踪...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time may change me, but I can't trace --
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.04,0:25:17.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真以为能够绑架地狱之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you really think you could kidnap the king of hell
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.18,0:25:20.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而不被人察觉吗  傻蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no one was gonna notice, dumb nuts?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.51,0:25:25.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.81,0:25:28.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的台词\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my line.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.59,0:25:30.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿比顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abbadon?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.82,0:25:32.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们说你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told me you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.95,0:25:34.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活蹦乱跳呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So not.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.29,0:25:36.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剩下的人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the rest of the cavalry?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.58,0:25:39.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没了  只有我这个老不死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, it's just little, old, unkillable me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.81,0:25:44.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.97,0:25:47.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有骑士还要步兵做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why send in a few grunts when you can send in a knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.13,0:25:50.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祈祷吧  小鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say your prayers, moose.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.53,0:25:55.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也行\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.29,0:25:57.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我松绑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Undo these.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.82,0:25:59.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要亲自干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill him myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.36,0:26:10.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是命令吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was an order, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.86,0:26:13.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是你的王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am your king.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.39,0:26:14.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}About that...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.27,0:26:21.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.36,0:26:22.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你的弓给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us your bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.90,0:26:23.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.32,0:26:29.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先礼后兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk first, stab later.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.69,0:26:34.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我从一个衣柜穿越到了2013年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what I find the most shocking about time-traveling 
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.63,0:26:37.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最让我震惊的是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}through a closet and landing in the year 2013?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.03,0:26:43.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然有人会让你来当地狱之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody thought it was a good idea to make you the king of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.73,0:26:48.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道那小屁孩想干什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what that boy's trying to do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.24,0:26:52.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想关闭地狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's trying to shut the gates of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.01,0:27:11.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在得先谈谈改朝换代的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now you and I are gonna talk about regime change.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.24,0:27:14.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You little whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.93,0:27:16.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是你的王...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am your k--
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.25,0:27:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肉身不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love the suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.41,0:27:52.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经很久不敢回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been afraid to go home for some time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.18,0:27:57.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前每天都有命令  如今却是一片混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orders used to come once a day, and now it's chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.61,0:27:59.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切似乎都崩溃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It all seems to be breaking down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.55,0:28:04.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得你能修复这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you think you can fix that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.47,0:28:08.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是需要一点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}With time, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.54,0:28:14.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就拿去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.11,0:28:21.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在我脑子里好顿折腾啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been digging.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.65,0:28:25.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this -- this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.26,0:28:27.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我这种籍籍无名之徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea what it would be like
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.31,0:28:32.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被上帝擢升\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be plucked from obscurity, 
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.90,0:28:35.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐在他脚下\N{\fnArial\fs30}to sit at God's feet,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.21,0:28:40.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我记录他的话语是什么感觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be asked to write down his word?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.06,0:28:46.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他走后我心痛不已\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ache I felt when he was gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.82,0:28:51.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不断告诉自己  "父亲走了"\N{\fnArial\fs30}telling myself, "Father's left,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.52,0:28:55.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但看看他留给了我们什么  天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}but look what he's left us -- paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.40,0:28:57.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你和那些大天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you and your archangels
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.63,0:28:59.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却不安于现状\N{\fnArial\fs30}couldn't leave well enough alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.30,0:29:04.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们逼得我远离家园\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ran me from my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.15,0:29:10.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为你们对我做出那等恶行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you really think you could do all of that to me
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.07,0:29:13.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还能全身而退吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there'd be no payback?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.50,0:29:30.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚表现得很好啊  小鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did good back there, moose.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.83,0:29:35.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当然不会承认说过这话  但我很骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll deny it if you ever quote me, but I'm a proud man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.10,0:29:36.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为你骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.88,0:29:39.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.56,0:29:41.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on. Uh, w-what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.97,0:29:43.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己看呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.52,0:29:45.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you joking?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.27,0:29:47.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.04,0:29:51.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-别搞笑了  -搞笑  我搞笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seriously? - Seriously? Me, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.87,0:29:54.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚刚可是并肩作战啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just shared a foxhole, you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.13,0:29:55.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们挫败了春节攻势(越战战役)\N{\fnArial\fs30}We beat back the Tet Offensive,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.36,0:29:58.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起躲过了南京大屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}outrun the -- the Rape of Nanking together!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.82,0:30:01.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你居然还要这样对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And still you're gonna do me like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.06,0:30:10.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,, 《兄弟连》  《太平洋战争》\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Band of brothers"? "The pacific"?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.49,0:30:12.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你完全没看过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of this means anything to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.03,0:30:14.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你待过那么多旅馆  \N{\fnArial\fs30}All those motels, 
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.60,0:30:18.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然一次都没看过HBO台\N{\fnArial\fs30}you never once watched HBO, not once?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.09,0:30:19.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,, 《衰姐们》\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Girls"?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.17,0:30:22.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是我的玛妮啊  小鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my Marnie, moose.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.69,0:30:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有汉娜  她只是想有人爱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-and Hannah -- she just -- she needs to be loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.80,0:30:27.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是她应得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She deserves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.98,0:30:32.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们每个人  你  我  都该得到爱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't we all -- you, me -- we deserve to be loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.53,0:30:35.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该得到爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I deserve to be loved!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.25,0:30:37.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是得到爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to be loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.93,0:30:41.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.06,0:30:42.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.03,0:31:05.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果可以的话  小鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would it be possible, moose...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.61,0:31:18.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能否答应我一个请求  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like... to ask you a-a favor, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.13,0:31:21.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earlier, 
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.85,0:31:28.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在里面忏悔的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you were confessing back there...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.86,0:31:32.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}...what did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.94,0:31:38.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这么问是因为  \N{\fnArial\fs30}I only ask because, 
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.12,0:31:42.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鉴于我的过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}given my history...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.39,0:31:47.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得好好考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}...it raises the question...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.45,0:31:53.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要从哪开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do I start...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.02,0:32:05.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寻求宽恕\N{\fnArial\fs30}...to even look for forgiveness?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.72,0:32:06.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.19,0:32:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就从这一针开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about we start with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.46,0:32:23.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我找到了天使测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I found the angel trials,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.80,0:32:25.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我找不到任何关于拿非利人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't see anything about a Nephilim
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.77,0:32:27.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或丘比特之弓之类的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a Cupid's bow or anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.52,0:32:29.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能吧  凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, Kev!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.40,0:32:30.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们离终点线就只差一步了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on the one-yard line here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.97,0:32:32.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我六个月前就该提出这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, a-and I should have mentioned this six months ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.80,0:32:35.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别用体育隐喻来激励我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the sports metaphors -- y-you want to motivate me,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.74,0:32:38.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,魔术卡片  天际  阿兹·安萨里\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Magic Cards, "Skyrim," Aziz Ansari.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.11,0:32:38.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.57,0:32:41.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我根本不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't know what those words mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.31,0:32:46.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是来和你打架的  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not here to fight you, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.19,0:32:47.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.09,0:32:48.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再也不会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.44,0:32:49.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.17,0:32:50.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梅塔特隆在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Metatron?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.57,0:32:52.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他告诉你他要挽救天堂  对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told you he was going to fix heaven, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.83,0:32:56.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀掉一个拿非利人  切下一个丘比特之弓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murdering a Nephilim, cutting off a Cupid's bow --
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.14,0:32:59.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些全是谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a lie, all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.17,0:33:01.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我读过他的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been in his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.15,0:33:03.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你读过我们每个人的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been in all our heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.32,0:33:04.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是问题所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.08,0:33:06.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  卡西迪奥  你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Castiel, you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.21,0:33:08.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是那样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.34,0:33:11.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你扭曲事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}You twist things.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.25,0:33:13.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在努力挽救天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to fix heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.71,0:33:15.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梅塔特隆也在挽救天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron is trying to fix heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.78,0:33:18.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梅塔特隆没打算挽救任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron isn't trying to fix anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.45,0:33:20.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想要毁掉天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's trying to break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.35,0:33:22.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为曾被逼走复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}An act of revenge for driving him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.82,0:33:23.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么毁掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break it how?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.74,0:33:24.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.03,0:33:27.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,驱逐天堂所有天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Expel all angels from heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.64,0:33:31.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像上帝驱逐路西法那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just as God cast out Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.70,0:33:34.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,驱逐到哪  地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cast you out to where? Hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.01,0:33:35.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.91,0:33:38.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成千上万的天使  下至人间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thousands of us, walking the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.88,0:33:39.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你说谎  -等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lies. - Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.10,0:33:47.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的使命是保护上帝所创造的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our mission was to protect what God created.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.06,0:33:51.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道我们何时忘掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know when we forgot that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.67,0:33:58.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我非常想看到你关上地狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want nothing more than to see you shut the gates of hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.02,0:34:01.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我曾说你可以信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I told you that you could trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.99,0:34:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果萨姆完成了测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Sam completes those trials, 
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.50,0:34:07.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就会死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}he is going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.20,0:34:08.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.51,0:34:11.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在梅塔特隆的脑海里看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it in Metatron's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.49,0:34:16.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这本来就是上帝的意图  最终的牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was always God's intention -- the ultimate sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.31,0:34:19.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至于你  卡西迪奥  \N{\fnArial\fs30}As for you, Castiel, 
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.88,0:34:23.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我求你  住手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg of you, stop this path.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.38,0:34:25.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梅塔特隆已经被制服了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron has been neutralized.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.77,0:34:30.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想回归  我会听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want back in, truly, I will listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.37,0:34:40.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, right now, talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.25,0:34:41.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是在撒谎吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.58,0:34:42.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.31,0:34:43.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快查出真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, find out!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.14,0:34:45.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-她在说谎  -把我去他那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's lying. - Take me to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.32,0:34:47.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-迪恩  -快带我去他那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean. - Take me to him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.93,0:34:53.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.50,0:34:57.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.20,0:35:10.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我没有错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I'm not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.17,0:35:12.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要挽救我的家园\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to fix my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.92,0:35:15.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.79,0:35:22.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小萨姆  停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.82,0:35:35.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她告诉你我说谎了  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}She told you I lied, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.44,0:35:39.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真应该听那个婊子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've listened to the bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.38,0:35:51.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别激动  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy there, Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.09,0:35:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别激动  我们的计划有微小的变动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take it easy. We got a slight change of plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.20,0:35:57.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.06,0:35:59.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-小卡在哪  -梅塔特隆说谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Cass?! - Metatron lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.30,0:36:02.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你完成了测试  你就会死掉  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You finish this trial, you're dead, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.31,0:36:09.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.73,0:36:13.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你发誓过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.36,0:36:22.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥  别再去想什么大计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel, I want you to stop thinking about master plans,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.90,0:36:26.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天堂  天使  和这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}heaven and angels, and all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.33,0:36:28.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那再也跟你没关系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't concern you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.15,0:36:36.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些根本就不是测试  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}These were never trials, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.42,0:36:38.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.20,0:36:42.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在从你身体里抽取的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what I'm taking from you now --
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.78,0:36:45.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的精髓  你的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your essence, your grace --
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.08,0:36:47.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是最后的元素\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the last piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.04,0:36:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无比美妙的事情即将发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now something wonderful is going to happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.70,0:37:02.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对你  对我  都是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}for me and for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.25,0:37:07.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你尽情享受你的新生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to live this new life to the fullest.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.41,0:37:09.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找个老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find a wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.14,0:37:10.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生一堆小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.82,0:37:14.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你死后  你的灵魂会重回天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you die and your soul comes to heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.37,0:37:15.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.92,0:37:18.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我你的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me your story.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.67,0:37:22.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.66,0:37:27.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.78,0:37:30.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看他  成功近在咫尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at him! Look how close we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.06,0:37:33.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我不完成  会有其他人死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other people will die if I don't finish this!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.95,0:37:35.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想想吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.90,0:37:38.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想想我们知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about what we know, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.19,0:37:42.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把灵魂从地狱中拉回来  治愈恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulling souls from hell, curing demons,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.19,0:37:44.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼  猎杀地狱犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}hell, ganking a hellhound!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.49,0:37:47.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们了解的知识足以扭转乾坤\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have enough knowledge on our side to turn the tide here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.52,0:37:50.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是没有你  我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't do it without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.06,0:37:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和我一起也很难做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can barely do it with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.10,0:37:55.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我把一切都搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you think I screw up everything I try.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.15,0:37:57.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我需要人陪着  记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I need a chaperone, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.27,0:37:58.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样  老弟  我不是那个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.68,0:38:01.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你就是这个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's exactly what you meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.63,0:38:04.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想知道我在那里忏悔了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to know what I confessed in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.71,0:38:07.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最大的罪过是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What my greatest sin was?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.21,0:38:12.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是我让你失望过太多次\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was how many times I let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.97,0:38:16.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不能这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.47,0:38:17.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam --
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.26,0:38:20.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你又觉得你不能信任我怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens when you've decided I can't be trusted again?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.07,0:38:23.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一次你不信任我时会去找谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, who are you gonna turn to next time instead of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.98,0:38:26.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再找个天使  再找个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another angel, another --
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.26,0:38:28.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再找个吸血鬼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another vampire?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.44,0:38:32.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道那是什么感觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea what it feels like
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.02,0:38:34.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-看着你的哥哥...  -打住\N{\fnArial\fs30}- to watch your brother just -- - Hold on, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.19,0:38:38.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的这么想吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seriously think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.70,0:38:42.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为事实绝不是你说的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because none of it -- none of it -- is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.49,0:38:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老弟  我知道我们有分歧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, man, I know we've had our disagreements, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.30,0:38:48.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我说过一些混蛋话让你感到沮丧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I know I've said some junk that set you back on your heels.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.91,0:38:52.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  小萨姆  别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Sammy...come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.94,0:38:56.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为了救你  害死了本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed Benny to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.42,0:38:58.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了让你活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm willing to let this bastard
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.12,0:39:01.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我愿放过这个混蛋和其他害死妈妈的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all the sons of bitches that killed mom walk because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.30,0:39:05.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过去或现在  你怎么可以认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you dare think that there is anything, past or present,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.75,0:39:07.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会把任何事看得比你还重\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I would put in front of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.83,0:39:11.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝不是那样的  绝不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has never been like that, ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.60,0:39:13.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你看清这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.56,0:39:15.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.75,0:39:25.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要怎么停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.64,0:39:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放弃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jus let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.74,0:39:30.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做不到  迪恩  这在我体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. It's in me, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.64,0:39:31.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道这是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what this feels like.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.86,0:39:37.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会想到办法的  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, listen, we will figure it out, okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.10,0:39:39.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一如往常\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like we always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.70,0:39:41.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.86,0:39:45.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来  放弃吧  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let it go, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.49,0:39:46.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放弃吧  老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let it go, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.29,0:39:52.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.48,0:39:56.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.36,0:40:01.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.28,0:40:04.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在  弟弟  你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you, little brother. You're gonna be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.97,0:40:07.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.09,0:40:09.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.65,0:40:11.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel?!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.65,0:40:12.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底死哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.49,0:40:46.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.51,0:41:13.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.66,0:41:37.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.15,0:41:45.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.95,0:41:51.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们坠落了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're falling.
